    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Bob the Zhero</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic adventure with Bob, the clumsiest superhero on his planet, surrounded by overly innocent inhabitants. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their world needs heroes, but do they really need Bob? It\u2019s up to you to prove it !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858020/extras/bb0e6c822de96fe014547bddd7b51258.poster.avif?t=1728072199\" width=518 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858020/extras/bb0e6c822de96fe014547bddd7b51258.webm?t=1728072199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858020/extras/bb0e6c822de96fe014547bddd7b51258.mp4?t=1728072199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crazy physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Bob overcome the everyday problems of his world through physics-based levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use his attraction power to pull objects towards you or move towards them. But be careful, your actions might cause unexpected chaos !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Total destruction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bob the Zhero, almost everything is destructible. Buildings can collapse or explode, and everything can be used to create chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you cause minimal damage and still be the hero everyone\u2019s counting on?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858020/extras/93e2a2919dd9306f8fd249aa307e4de1.poster.avif?t=1728072199\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858020/extras/93e2a2919dd9306f8fd249aa307e4de1.webm?t=1728072199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heroic Rescue</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you\u2019ll need to save the inhabitants from all sorts of dangers: collapsing buildings, explosions, reckless drivers, and more. You\u2019ll quickly realize that Bob\u2019s world isn\u2019t very well-designed. Will you manage to become the hero everyone hopes for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858020/extras/d4060f5224e77dafa0750d194cbfa1c5.poster.avif?t=1728072199\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858020/extras/d4060f5224e77dafa0750d194cbfa1c5.webm?t=1728072199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858020/extras/d4060f5224e77dafa0750d194cbfa1c5.mp4?t=1728072199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the quirky universe of Bob the Zhero and explore a sandbox game full of surprises and challenges. Are you ready to help Bob play the superhero?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Bob the Zhero</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic adventure with Bob, the clumsiest superhero on his planet, surrounded by overly innocent inhabitants. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their world needs heroes, but do they really need Bob? It\u2019s up to you to prove it !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858020/extras/bb0e6c822de96fe014547bddd7b51258.poster.avif?t=1728072199\" width=518 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858020/extras/bb0e6c822de96fe014547bddd7b51258.webm?t=1728072199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858020/extras/bb0e6c822de96fe014547bddd7b51258.mp4?t=1728072199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crazy physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Bob overcome the everyday problems of his world through physics-based levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use his attraction power to pull objects towards you or move towards them. But be careful, your actions might cause unexpected chaos !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Total destruction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bob the Zhero, almost everything is destructible. Buildings can collapse or explode, and everything can be used to create chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you cause minimal damage and still be the hero everyone\u2019s counting on?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858020/extras/93e2a2919dd9306f8fd249aa307e4de1.poster.avif?t=1728072199\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858020/extras/93e2a2919dd9306f8fd249aa307e4de1.webm?t=1728072199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heroic Rescue</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you\u2019ll need to save the inhabitants from all sorts of dangers: collapsing buildings, explosions, reckless drivers, and more. You\u2019ll quickly realize that Bob\u2019s world isn\u2019t very well-designed. Will you manage to become the hero everyone hopes for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858020/extras/d4060f5224e77dafa0750d194cbfa1c5.poster.avif?t=1728072199\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858020/extras/d4060f5224e77dafa0750d194cbfa1c5.webm?t=1728072199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858020/extras/d4060f5224e77dafa0750d194cbfa1c5.mp4?t=1728072199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the quirky universe of Bob the Zhero and explore a sandbox game full of surprises and challenges. Are you ready to help Bob play the superhero?</p>",
    "short_description": "Meet Bob, the clumsy hero with a heart of gold. With no real threat, Bob is just playing the superhero, trying to save his planet. But his blunders might make him more famous than his heroic deeds. Will he become a true savior or a legend of mishaps?",
